      "value": "My first attempt at uploading this also occurred. When trying to test, I would be brought my vrchat home. Will update is solved.\nEDIT: I didn't have those issues when force quitting. Luckily, on next upload attempt, it worked.\nMy guess, because I had a different upload menu the first time, It thought I was a higher-level user than I am right now, and couldnt push the variables through.\nMaybe not, but when I did it the 2nd time, my menu looked a lot simpler and didnt ask if I would like my world to show up in the tags like \"Hot\" & \"New\"",
