  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you try to update an existing world while the world info is still being fetched - the upload process will get stuck in the \"Preparing for Upload\" state and you have to kill unity completely to get out of it, which is not a great experience and can cause some unpredictable issues due to unity not being terminated properly (people reported corrupted asset references too).\nIt would be nice to disable the upload button until the world info was fetched / it was determined that the world doesn't exist, so the user will never end up in that state.\nSDK3 ver for reference: VRCSDK3-UDON-2020.05.12.10.33_Public",
